UID:KIM4iR4JAqV9XbQJOReSe
SUMMARY:Comedy Cellar Las Vegas Showcase (Early)
DTSTAMP:20260719T101346Z
DTSTART:20260720T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \n\n  \n     Official Tickets\n   \n  \n     Resale
	 Tickets\n  \n\nComedy Cellar Las Vegas brings one of the most legendary n
	ames in stand-up comedy to the heart of Las Vegas. Located inside the Rio 
	Hotel & Casino\, this intimate comedy club is the West Coast home of New Y
	ork City’s world-famous Comedy Cellar\, the venue that helped launch the c
	areers of comedy icons including Dave Chappelle\, Chris Rock\, Jon Stewart
	\, Ray Romano\, Amy Schumer\, Aziz Ansari\, and countless others. \nUnlike
	 traditional comedy shows featuring a single headliner\, Comedy Cellar pre
	sents a carefully curated lineup of professional comedians every night. Au
	diences can expect multiple performers during each show\, featuring a mix 
	of nationally touring headliners\, television favorites\, Comedy Central v
	eterans\, Netflix performers\, and rising stars from around the world. \nN
	o two shows are exactly alike\, making every visit a unique experience. Su
	rprise drop-in appearances from major comedians performing elsewhere in La
	s Vegas have become part of the club’s reputation\, giving audiences the c
	hance to see comedy superstars in an intimate setting. \nEvent Details\nVe
	nue: Comedy Cellar Las Vegas at Rio Hotel & Casino\nLocation: 3700 W Flami
	ngo Rd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89103\nShow Schedule: Nightly performances through
	out the year\nAge Requirement: Recommended for audiences 18+ due to mature
	 comedy content \nAbout the Venue\nOpened in 2018\, Comedy Cellar Las Vega
	s was designed to recreate the atmosphere and energy of the original Green
	wich Village club that has become one of the most respected comedy venues 
	in the world. The 300-seat showroom offers excellent sightlines and an int
	imate setting that allows audiences to experience stand-up comedy exactly 
	as it was meant to be seen: up close and personal. \nThe venue combines th
	e excitement of a Las Vegas night out with the authentic feel of a classic
	 New York comedy club. Guests can enjoy a comfortable showroom environment
	 while watching some of the best comedians working today perform in a sett
	ing that encourages spontaneity\, crowd interaction\, and unforgettable mo
	ments. \nConveniently located inside the Rio Hotel & Casino just minutes f
	rom the Las Vegas Strip\, the venue offers easy access for both tourists a
	nd local comedy fans. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a fast-paced evening featur
	ing multiple comedians performing throughout the show. The Comedy Cellar i
	s known for showcasing a wide variety of comedic styles\, from observation
	al humor and storytelling to sharp social commentary\, crowd work\, and cu
	tting-edge stand-up. \nWhether you’re discovering a future comedy star or 
	watching a seasoned veteran perfect their craft\, every show delivers the 
	authentic comedy club experience that has made the Comedy Cellar one of th
	e most respected brands in stand-up comedy. \nFor comedy fans visiting Las
	 Vegas\, Comedy Cellar is widely considered one of the best places in the 
	city to experience live stand-up comedy any night of the week.\n\nhttps://
	comedycalendar.com/event/comedy-cellar-las-vegas-showcase-early/2026-07-20
	/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/comedy-cellar-las-vegas-showcase-early
	/2026-07-20/
LOCATION:Comedy Cellar Las Vegas at Rio Hotel & Casino\, 3700 W Flamingo Rd
	\, Las Vegas\, NV\, 89103\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:comedy-calendar
CATEGORIES:Comedy Calendar
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com
 /wp-content/uploads/2026/06/7ed77c01-a1f5-4d0d-9243-cbc0a49daafa_CUSTOM-q7
 Gv63.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://comedycalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/06/7ed77c01-a1f5-4d0d-9243-cbc0a49daafa_CUSTOM-q7Gv63.jpg
UID:CW98vQkndUuji0q2frgJb
SUMMARY:Mark Schiff LIVE at Laugh Factory Las Vegas
DTSTAMP:20260719T101346Z
DTSTART:20260720T203000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMark Schiff is a vetera
	n stand-up comedian with over four decades of experience making audiences 
	laugh across the country. A close friend and frequent collaborator of Jerr
	y Seinfeld\, Mark is widely respected in the comedy world for his clean\, 
	clever\, and deeply relatable humor. \nHis comedy draws from real life — f
	amily\, relationships\, aging\, and the absurdities of everyday existence 
	— delivered with the kind of warmth and precision that only a true comedy 
	craftsman can achieve. Mark has appeared on The Tonight Show\, Late Night 
	with David Letterman\, and numerous other television programs\, and has re
	leased multiple acclaimed stand-up specials. \nSeeing Mark Schiff live at 
	the Laugh Factory in Las Vegas is a treat for fans of classic\, well-craft
	ed stand-up comedy. His shows are consistently funny\, heartfelt\, and lea
	ve audiences feeling genuinely uplifted. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\,
	 July 20\, 2026 (runs through July 22)\nTime: 8:30 PM\nVenue: Laugh Factor
	y at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\nS
	how Duration: Approximately 90 minutes\n\nAbout the Venue\nThe Laugh Facto
	ry at Horseshoe Las Vegas is one of the premier comedy destinations on the
	 Las Vegas Strip. Located inside the iconic Horseshoe Hotel and Casino at 
	3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, this club is part of the legendary Laugh Factory b
	rand that has been a cornerstone of American stand-up comedy for decades. 
	\nThe venue features tiered seating with excellent sightlines\, a full-ser
	vice bar\, and an intimate atmosphere that puts you close to the action. T
	he Laugh Factory’s rotating roster of headliners ensures there’s always so
	mething new and exciting to see\, making it a must-visit for comedy fans o
	n the Strip. \nParking is available at the Horseshoe Las Vegas parking gar
	age. The venue is conveniently located on the Strip and easily accessible 
	from surrounding hotels and attractions. \nWhat to Expect\nMark Schiff’s L
	as Vegas engagement at the Laugh Factory is a multi-night stand-up showcas
	e featuring his signature blend of clean\, observational humor and persona
	l storytelling. Expect an evening of genuine laughs delivered by one of co
	medy’s most respected veterans. \nThe show runs approximately 90 minutes a
	nd may include an opening act. Mark’s warm stage presence and masterful ti
	ming create an atmosphere that feels both intimate and electric. This is t
	he kind of comedy show that reminds you why live stand-up is one of the gr
	eatest forms of entertainment. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $30 – $5
	5 (fees may apply) \nTickets are available through Ticketmaster (official)
	. Don’t miss your chance to see a comedy legend live in Las Vegas! \nOffic
	ial Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission
	 at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-schiff-
	live-at-laugh-factory-las-vegas/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-schiff-live-at-laugh-factory-las-
	vegas/
LOCATION:Laugh Factory at Horseshoe Las Vegas\, 3645 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las
	 Vegas\, NV\, 89109\, USA
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:comedy-calendar
CATEGORIES:Comedy Calendar
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT
